  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>z</mi></math> are in arithmetic progression and <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mrow></math> are also in arithmetic progression, then",
